Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:04.39,EN,,0,0,0,,DEE Cognitive is an experimental\Nsystem oriented towards intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.58,0:00:07.56,EN,,0,0,0,,It operates in a three-dimensional\Ncomputational universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:09.53,EN,,0,0,0,,It has already demonstrated\Nlearning, memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.56,0:00:12.57,EN,,0,0,0,,composition and\Ncommunication in specific trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:14.28,EN,,0,0,0,,It is more than an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.37,0:00:18.00,EN,,0,0,0,,It aims to retain experience\Nand use it in new situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.30,0:00:21.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Some capabilities already work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.32,0:00:22.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Let us see how.
